From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: realtek: add the RTL9607DQ and the VSOL HG325AX30

Document the Realtek RTL9607DQ ("Taurus") PON SoC and the VSOL HG325AX30
GPON ONU built on it.

Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
Index: linux-6.18.60/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/realtek.yaml
===================================================================
--- linux-6.18.60.orig/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/realtek.yaml
+++ linux-6.18.60/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/realtek.yaml
@@ -55,6 +55,13 @@
               - realtek,mjolnir # Realtek Mjolnir EVB
           - const: realtek,rtd1619
 
+      # RTL9607DQ SoC based boards
+      - items:
+          - enum:
+              - vsol,hg325ax30 # VSOL HG325AX30
+          - const: realtek,rtl9607dq
+          - const: realtek,taurus
+
 additionalProperties: true
 
 ...
